# Spellgyre, the second mode: "Surveil 2, then draw two cards." The top two cards are Lightning Bolt and Counterspell, then Island and
# Mountain: Counterspell goes to the graveyard and Lightning Bolt stays on top, so the surveil finishes before the draw and the
# two cards drawn are the Bolt that was kept and the Island beneath.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Spellgyre
Island x4
Lightning Bolt
Counterspell
Island
Mountain
Island x9

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Spellgyre.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Surveil 2, then draw two cards)
Bot1.Arrange(Lightning Bolt | Counterspell)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Spellgyre; Counterspell; Black Lotus
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Lightning Bolt; Island
